title: v1.0 media-bin pivot + bottom timeline — full bundle landed (autonomous loop)
summary: 'v1.0 media-bin + bottom timeline + sidebar-drag bundle shipped end-to-end via autonomous team orchestration. S0 (shared types) → Wave A (3 parallel Kits: backend, timeline UI, UI shell) → Wave B (sidebar drag affordance) → pre-commit gates (Aegis SHIP zero blockers, Scribe .purpose sweep, Probe test sweep, Judge caught 1 mid-wave blocker on envelope fields, Rune portal compliance). CHANGELOG updated. Workspace tests: 1176 → 1189. Zero tsc errors. Portal + aspect compliance green. 11 new symbols across 4 commits on feat/creator-flow-v1-prep.'
